2
00:07:21,008 --> 00:07:27,008
ないない
[Nai Nai]

3
00:07:32,808 --> 00:07:34,208
ない ない
No, no...

4
00:07:35,208 --> 00:07:39,208
灰のない 深い 影ばかり
A mere dark shadow without ash

5
00:07:39,508 --> 00:07:43,508
アイのない 個体 人形みたい
A loveless individual, like a doll

6
00:07:43,608 --> 00:07:48,208
自分不在 どこにもいない
A nonexistent "self", nowhere to be found

7
00:07:48,208 --> 00:07:49,608
ないじゃない？
I'm not, right?

8
00:07:50,208 --> 00:07:54,008
何者でもないまま
I remain as nobody...

9
00:07:54,008 --> 00:07:57,608
何もできないまま
...unable to do anything.

10
00:07:58,008 --> 00:08:01,408
生きるのは無駄ですか
Is it pointless to live this way?

11
00:08:01,408 --> 00:08:04,008
悪いことですか
Is it wrong to do so?

12
00:08:04,508 --> 00:08:09,108
ここにいない いない いない いないのは
What is missing, missing, missing here...

13
00:08:09,108 --> 00:08:12,508
自分 自分
...is myself, myself.

14
00:08:12,508 --> 00:08:16,708
誰も見ない 見ない 見ないままで
With nobody, nobody, nobody looking,

15
00:08:16,708 --> 00:08:20,208
掃き捨ててさようなら
sweep it all away, goodbye.

16
00:08:20,208 --> 00:08:26,908
嬉しくない 悲しくもない 透明な気分
Unable to feel happy or sad, my mood is transparent.

17
00:08:26,908 --> 00:08:31,108
足りない自分 合わす貌もない
I lack even the face to match my lacking self.

18
00:08:31,108 --> 00:08:34,408
ない ない ない
Not there, not there, not there...

19
00:08:34,408 --> 00:08:37,408
笑えないじゃない
There's no way I can laugh, right?

20
00:08:39,808 --> 00:08:44,108
灰じゃない私 閉じたまま貝
The "I" not made of ash is a closed shell.

21
00:08:44,108 --> 00:08:47,108
返事「ハイ」期待だけ大
Responding "aye", the expectations are great.

22
00:08:47,108 --> 00:08:51,108
嫌々投げられた賽
The die reluctantly thrown out,

23
00:08:51,108 --> 00:08:53,808
出目は知らない
what number it rolled, I don't know.

24
00:09:08,608 --> 00:09:13,108
ここにいたい いたい いたい いたいのも
The person who wants to stay, stay, stay here...

25
00:09:13,108 --> 00:09:16,208
自分 自分
...is myself, myself.

26
00:09:16,208 --> 00:09:20,508
味はにがい にがい にがいままで
It's bitter, bitter, and with a bitter taste,

27
00:09:20,508 --> 00:09:24,108
当て処無くさようなら
I say goodbye to nowhere.

28
00:09:24,108 --> 00:09:30,608
帰らない 行く先もない 迷子の気分
With nowhere to return and no destination, like a lost child.

29
00:09:30,608 --> 00:09:34,808
間違えてない？ まだ分からない
Am I not mistaken? I still don't know.

30
00:09:34,808 --> 00:09:38,008
ない ない ない
Not there, not there, not there...

31
00:09:38,008 --> 00:09:41,408
どうだっていいじゃない
But I don't care anymore, right?

32
00:10:02,956 --> 00:10:04,256
影も
Shadows

33
00:10:04,256 --> 00:10:05,356
形も
and shapes,

34
00:10:05,356 --> 00:10:07,556
いっそなくして
I might as well just lose them

35
00:10:07,556 --> 00:10:10,356
しまえばいい
completely.

36
00:10:11,256 --> 00:10:12,056
また はい
Or from the ashes,

37
00:10:12,056 --> 00:10:13,156
ひとつひとつ
one by one,

38
00:10:13,156 --> 00:10:14,256
から
we can

39
00:10:14,256 --> 00:10:18,556
始めればいい
start over.

40
00:10:19,756 --> 00:10:21,456
ここにいない
The one who isn't here,

41
00:10:21,456 --> 00:10:23,056
いない いないのは
isn't here, isn't here,

42
00:10:23,056 --> 00:10:25,956
自分 自分
is me, myself.

43
00:10:26,956 --> 00:10:28,656
誰も見ない
Without anyone looking,

44
00:10:28,656 --> 00:10:30,356
見ない 見ないまま
looking, looking,

45
00:10:30,356 --> 00:10:32,156
掻き消して
I'll erase it

46
00:10:32,156 --> 00:10:34,156
さよなら
and say goodbye.

47
00:10:36,456 --> 00:10:37,956
嬉しくない
I'm not happy,

48
00:10:37,956 --> 00:10:39,956
悲しくもない
nor am I sad,

49
00:10:39,956 --> 00:10:42,756
透明な気分
a transparent feeling.

50
00:10:43,356 --> 00:10:44,456
足りない
Not enough,

51
00:10:44,456 --> 00:10:45,456
自分
myself,

52
00:10:45,456 --> 00:10:47,756
合わす顔もない
no face to show either.

53
00:10:48,256 --> 00:10:49,356
ない
With nothing,

54
00:10:49,956 --> 00:10:50,956
ない
nothing,

55
00:10:51,256 --> 00:10:53,056
